                history: `In Sid Meier's Pirates!, you take on the role of a privateer in the 17th-century Caribbean. You sail between the colonies of the European powers, trade goods, fight enemy ships, search for hidden treasure and hunt notorious pirates. Your decisions determine whether history remembers you as a feared pirate or a respected privateer.`,
                review: `Sid Meier's Pirates! is one of the most timeless classics ever made. Its perfect combination of naval battles, trading, treasure hunting and exploration still provides countless hours of enjoyment today. Hardly any other game captures the feeling of being a pirate as convincingly as this masterpiece. For me, Pirates! remains one of the finest games ever developed. Whether played on the C64 or the Amiga, it is an absolute highlight of video game history.`,
