                    "history": "In Kaiser, you assume the role of an ambitious territorial ruler in the sixteenth-century Holy Roman Empire. Through skilful trading, the development of your towns and diplomatic ability, you seek to gain prestige and power. At the same time, you must provide for your subjects, manage taxes and prevail against rival rulers.",
                    "review": "Kaiser is one of the great classics of the business-simulation genre for me. It combines trade, politics and resource management in a way that remains engaging today. Despite its simple presentation, the game offers surprising strategic depth, and every session develops differently. Anyone who enjoys historical building and management games should experience this milestone.",
