                    "review": "Der Patrizier remains one of the finest business simulations ever made for me. Slowly building a trading empire and the convincing Hanseatic atmosphere keep drawing me back. It has admittedly aged in places and lacks several modern convenience features, but its underlying design is timeless and remains very playable today.",
