                    "description": "Rise of the Dragon is a dark cyberpunk adventure by Dynamix that combines a detective story, comic-book presentation and an unusually consequential passage of time.",
                    "history": "Rise of the Dragon was released for MS-DOS in 1990, developed by Dynamix and published by Sierra On-Line. Set in Los Angeles in 2053, it casts the player as private detective William 'Blade' Hunter. The story blends classic detective fiction with cyberpunk, drug trafficking and conspiracy. Its comic-like presentation, large illustrations and real-time schedule—where missed appointments can have consequences—were particularly distinctive.",
                    "review": "The adventure remains notable above all for its atmosphere. Its bleak vision of the future and comic presentation still possess character, while some controls and action sequences clearly show their age. Fans of early cyberpunk games will find an important and idiosyncratic example here.",
