                        "The DOS version was released in 1990.",
                        "The game was developed by Dynamix.",
                        "Its story takes place in Los Angeles in 2053.",
                        "Time passes during play and influences events.",
                        "Versions later appeared for Amiga, Macintosh and Sega CD."
