                    "history": "Legend Entertainment released Spellcasting 101 for DOS in 1990. Writer Steve Meretzky, previously known for his work at Infocom, combined a traditional text parser with graphics and mouse support. Protagonist Ernie Eaglebeak begins studying at Sorcerer University and stumbles into a series of magical and comic adventures.",
