                    "history": "Catacomb 3-D was released for DOS in 1991 under Softdisk's Gamer's Edge label. Developed by id Software, it has players explore fantasy catacombs from a first-person perspective and fight enemies with magical projectiles. Technologically, it was an important step toward Wolfenstein 3D and later Doom.",
