                    "history": "Wacky Wheels was released in 1994 and developed by Beavis Soft. Apogee published it using its familiar shareware model. Technically and mechanically, it drew inspiration from early console kart racers while bringing that formula convincingly to DOS PCs. The Deluxe or full version provides the complete selection of tracks and game modes.",
