                    "history": "The game was released for PlayStation, Sega Saturn and PC in 1996. Following the style of WWF WrestleMania: The Arcade Game, it favors fast, fighting-game-like action over realistic wrestling. Well-known WWF performers of the period compete with exaggerated moves in themed arenas.",
