                    "history": "Z was released for DOS and Windows in 1996 and developed by The Bitmap Brothers. The game revolves around territorial conquest: controlling a flag usually grants control of the local production facility. This creates constantly shifting front lines and far more dynamic battles than many traditional base-building strategy games.",
